# Made by the chef in Russian: составлено, печётся, открыли
subtitle: "Ресторан открыли, хлеб печётся, меню составлено шеф-поваром: three Russian passives and when to use each, as Masha writes the announcement for «Кухонька»."
tags: ["russian","russian passive","составлено","passive voice","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/passive"]
thumb: "band \"Made by the chef\" stamp \"PASSIVE\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Stop working at night in Russian: aspect after перестать, успеть","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/219-russian-stop-working.cast"}

## Made by the chef in Russian: составлено, печётся, открыли
